tion</strong> </p><p>9.1. Either party may not terminate this Agreement, unless agreed by both parties. </p><p>9.2. Upon termination, the Client will compensate SPACEWORK for all work completed up to the termination date.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>10. Dispute Resolution</strong> </p><p>10.1. Any disputes arising from this Agreement will be resolved amicably through negotiations. </p><p>10.2. If negotiations fail, disputes will be subject to arbitration under the Rules of Conciliation and Arbitration at the Beirut Chamber of Commerce and Industry by three (3) Arbitrators appointed in accordance with the said rules. The said arbitrators shall have full power to open up, review and revise any decision, opinion, instruction, determination, certificate or valuation of the Engineer related to the dispute.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>11. Governing Law</strong> </p><p>This Agreement is governed by the laws of Lebanon.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>12. Entire Agreement</strong> </p><p>This Agreement constitutes the entire understanding between the parties and supersedes all prior agreements, understandings, or representations.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>13. Amendments</strong> </p><p>This Agreement may only be amended in writing and signed by both parties.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>IN WITNESS WHEREOF</strong>, the parties have executed this Agreement as of the date first written above.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>For SPACEWORK SARL</strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Kevin J. Gemayel</strong></p><p><em>Managing Director</em><br></p>'
