d be settled in U.S.D Cash or USD Fresh Bank Transfer, exclusive of applicable taxes and transfer fees. </p><p>5.2. Payment milestones are as follows: </p><p class="rt-in1">a. 25% upon signing this Agreement. </p><p class="rt-in1">b. 25% upon submission of Materials and systems</p><p class="rt-in1">c. 20% upon submission of specifications</p><p class="rt-in1">d. 20% upon submission of Facade General Drawings</p><p class="rt-in1">e. 10% Remaining balance upon delivery of final drawings and specifications. </p><p>5.3. Payments must be made within 15 days of receiving an invoice, and payment delay will cause a direct delay to the project delivery.</p><h2><strong>6. Intellectual Property</strong> </h2><p>6.1. All designs, drawings, and specifications provided by SPACEWORK remain its intellectual property until full payment is received. </p><p>6.2. Upon full payment, the Client receives a non-exclusive license to use the deliverables solely for the specified project. </p><p>6.3. SPACEWORK retains the right to use the designs for promotional and portfolio purposes.</p><h2><strong>7. Confidentiality</strong> </h2><p>7.1. Both parties agree to keep all project-related information confidential and not disclose it to any third party without prior written consent, except as required by law.</p><h2><strong>8. Liability and Warranty</strong> </h2><p>8.1. SPACEWORK will perform its services with professional care and diligence. </p><p>8.2. SPACEWORK is not liable for any project delays or costs arising from factors beyond its control, including Client-provided information or third-party dependencies. </p><p>8.3. The Client acknowledges that the deliverables are conceptual and may require further detailing and adjustment by third parties during execution.</p><h2><strong>9. Termination</strong> </h2><p>9.1. Either party may not terminate this Agreement, unless agreed by both parties. </p><p>9.2. Upon termination, the Client will compensate SPACEWORK for all work completed up to the